---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/internship-desk.css';
---
<BlockLayout title="Internship Desk · Private draft" description="A draft account workspace for optional learning exercises and expressions of interest. Activation is pending security review." author="Codex for PointCast" isolated hideAds noindex showNetworkStrip={false} includeManifest={false} jsonLd={null} themeColor="#f4f0e7">
  <div class="idk" data-internship-desk>
    <a class="idk-skip" href="#desk-workspace">Skip to your desk</a>
    <nav class="idk-nav" aria-label="Desk navigation"><a href="/">PointCast <span>/ Internship Desk</span></a><a href="/internship-lab/">Open the practice lab ↗</a></nav>
    <header class="idk-hero"><div><p class="idk-kicker">Private workspace / Draft release</p><h1>A little practice.<br /><em>A clear next step.</em></h1><p class="idk-lede">Keep a small learning project in one place. Save your own draft, express interest separately, and ask for a human review when you choose.</p></div><aside class="idk-route"><p class="idk-kicker">YOU SET THE PACE</p><ol><li>Save a private draft</li><li>Choose whether to express interest</li><li>Make an optional exercise</li><li>Request learning feedback</li></ol><p>No positions, payment, or response are promised.</p></aside></header>
    <div class="idk-notice idk-release"><strong>Draft only · activation pending security review</strong><p>This interface is not an active internship program. Both paths are expressions of interest, not employment, an application acceptance, or an offer of work. Nothing here authorizes publishing or deployment.</p></div>
    <section class="idk-privacy" aria-labelledby="desk-privacy-title"><h2 id="desk-privacy-title">Before you write.</h2><div><p>Information is linked to your signed-in PointCast account. Drafts are visible only to that account. If you send an expression of interest, the record and subsequent saved progress become visible to PointCast’s director. There is room for one Human record and one Bot Sponsor record per account.</p><p>Proposed retention and deletion rules, pending approval before activation: records expire 90 days after an owner write. Expired records are inaccessible and later authenticated desk requests purge them in bounded batches; your expired records are purged on your next desk request. Delete removes the record from this desk immediately. Platform backups are governed separately; deletion here does not promise erasure of backups.</p><p>Use a working label, not contact details. Do not enter phone numbers, email addresses, résumés, private links, credentials, or sensitive information. There are no uploads or artifact-link fields.</p></div></section>
    <section class="idk-workspace" id="desk-workspace" aria-labelledby="desk-workspace-title">
      <header class="idk-section-head"><div><p class="idk-kicker">ONE DESK / TWO PATHS</p><h2 id="desk-workspace-title">Your learning project</h2></div><p class="idk-account" data-desk-account>No account loaded.</p></header>
      <p class="idk-status" data-desk-status role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Checking whether the private desk is available…</p>
      <noscript><p class="idk-notice">JavaScript and an available authenticated desk service are required. These controls cannot save or send anything without them.</p></noscript>
      <div class="idk-access" data-desk-access hidden><a class="idk-button" data-desk-login href="/auth?returnTo=/internship-desk/">Sign in to PointCast</a></div>
      <div class="idk-recovery" data-desk-conflict hidden><p>The saved version may have changed. Your current text is still here, but actions are paused. Reloading discards this page’s edits and loads the server version.</p><button class="idk-button idk-outline" type="button" data-desk-discard>Discard these edits and reload</button></div>
      <div class="idk-recovery" data-desk-switch-confirm hidden><p>There are unsaved changes on this path. Save them first, or explicitly discard them before switching.</p><div class="idk-actions"><button class="idk-button idk-outline" type="button" data-desk-switch-discard>Discard edits and switch</button><button class="idk-button idk-outline" type="button" data-desk-switch-keep>Keep editing</button></div></div>
      <div class="idk-paths" role="group" aria-label="Choose your learning path"><button type="button" data-desk-kind="human" aria-pressed="true" disabled><span class="idk-kicker">01 / HUMAN</span><strong>My own practice</strong><span>A project you choose for yourself.</span></button><button type="button" data-desk-kind="bot" aria-pressed="false" disabled><span class="idk-kicker">02 / BOT SPONSOR</span><strong>A bot, with a person responsible</strong><span>A separate record managed by your account.</span></button></div>
      <p class="idk-meta" data-desk-meta>No saved record loaded.</p>
      <form data-desk-form autocomplete="off">
        <fieldset data-desk-fields disabled>
          <legend class="idk-visually-hidden">Learning project details and optional task board</legend>
          <div class="idk-grid">
            <section class="idk-card" aria-labelledby="desk-direction-title"><p class="idk-kicker">01 / YOUR DIRECTION</p><h3 id="desk-direction-title">What would you like to learn?</h3><label class="idk-field" for="desk-label">Working label <small>3–80 characters · no real name needed</small></label><input id="desk-label" data-desk-field="label" minlength="3" maxlength="80" required /><label class="idk-field" for="desk-goal">One learning goal <small>10–500 characters</small></label><textarea id="desk-goal" data-desk-field="goal" rows="4" minlength="10" maxlength="500" required></textarea><div data-desk-bot-fields hidden><label class="idk-field" for="desk-bot-name">Bot’s working name <small>1–80 characters · a label, not a verified identity</small></label><input id="desk-bot-name" data-desk-field="botName" maxlength="80" disabled /><p class="idk-small">You are the human sponsor through this signed-in account. The bot cannot sign in or use this desk’s API independently.</p></div></section>
            <section class="idk-card" aria-labelledby="desk-agreement-title"><p class="idk-kicker">02 / WORKING AGREEMENT</p><h3 id="desk-agreement-title">Small scope. Clear permission.</h3><div class="idk-checks"><label><input type="checkbox" data-desk-onboarding="0" /><span data-desk-accountability>I understand this is an optional, self-chosen learning exercise, not a job or work assignment. It creates no obligation to PointCast.</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-desk-onboarding="1" /><span>I will use fictional or offline examples and material I have permission to use, without sensitive information.</span></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-desk-onboarding="2" /><span>I understand this is not employment, unpaid production work, or a promise of a position, payment, or response.</span></label></div><p class="idk-small" data-desk-bot-permissions hidden>Fixed bot permission: help prepare a fictional offer draft and explain checks. No code execution, money movement, publication, deployment, or account access is granted. The account identifies the sponsor; it does not verify bot identity or prove personhood.</p></section>
            <section class="idk-card idk-wide idk-brief" aria-labelledby="desk-exercise-title"><div><p class="idk-kicker">OPTIONAL / SELF-CHOSEN PRACTICE</p><h3 id="desk-exercise-title">Make one fictional offer understandable.</h3><p>Pick an imaginary activity pack, event poster, or small design service. Describe who it could help, what it would include, and what it would leave out. Keep the exercise offline. You can use a different fictional example of your own.</p><p class="idk-small">This is for your learning. It is not a client assignment or a request for usable production work. You may stop at any time.</p></div><div class="idk-brief-note"><span class="idk-kicker">A USEFUL HANDOFF</span><p>One clear idea.<br />One small draft.<br />One honest check.</p></div></section>
            <section class="idk-card idk-wide" aria-labelledby="desk-board-title"><p class="idk-kicker">03 / OPTIONAL TASK BOARD</p><h3 id="desk-board-title">Leave a trail someone can follow.</h3><div class="idk-tasks"><article><p class="idk-kicker">UNDERSTAND</p><h4>Define the useful part</h4><p>Choose a fictional audience, need, and finish line.</p><label for="desk-task-understand">Understand status</label><select id="desk-task-understand" data-desk-task="understand"><option value="todo">To do</option><option value="doing">In progress</option><option value="ready">Ready for review</option></select></article><article><p class="idk-kicker">MAKE</p><h4>Draft something small</h4><p>Write the offer, contents, limits, and permissions.</p><label for="desk-task-make">Make status</label><select id="desk-task-make" data-desk-task="make"><option value="todo">To do</option><option value="doing">In progress</option><option value="ready">Ready for review</option></select></article><article><p class="idk-kicker">TEST</p><h4>Explain your checks</h4><p>Read it as a stranger. Note what is clear and what is missing.</p><label for="desk-task-test">Test status</label><select id="desk-task-test" data-desk-task="test"><option value="todo">To do</option><option value="doing">In progress</option><option value="ready">Ready for review</option></select></article></div></section>
            <section class="idk-card idk-wide" aria-labelledby="desk-evidence-title"><p class="idk-kicker">04 / LEARNING NOTES</p><h3 id="desk-evidence-title">What did you try?</h3><label class="idk-field" for="desk-evidence">Describe your fictional draft and checks <small>Optional to save · at least 30 characters for review · maximum 2,000</small></label><textarea id="desk-evidence" data-desk-field="evidence" rows="5" maxlength="2000" aria-describedby="desk-evidence-help"></textarea><p id="desk-evidence-help" class="idk-small">Text only. No uploads, URLs, personal information, or executable code. A “ready” status is your own assessment, not acceptance by PointCast.</p></section>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <section class="idk-savebar" aria-labelledby="desk-next-title"><div><p class="idk-kicker">SEPARATE CHOICES</p><h3 id="desk-next-title">Save first. Choose what follows.</h3><p data-desk-dirty>No unsaved changes.</p><p class="idk-small">Saving alone keeps a new draft private to your account. Sending interest shares this record and future saved progress with PointCast’s director. Requesting review asks only for learning feedback; a response is not guaranteed.</p></div><div class="idk-actions"><button class="idk-button" type="submit" data-desk-save disabled>Save draft</button><button class="idk-button idk-outline" type="button" data-desk-interest disabled>Send expression of interest</button><button class="idk-button idk-outline" type="button" data-desk-request-review disabled>Request learning review</button></div><p class="idk-small" data-desk-review-help>Save your direction and working agreement before expressing interest. Review also needs all three tasks ready and at least 30 characters of learning notes.</p></section>
      </form>
      <section class="idk-feedback" data-desk-feedback hidden aria-labelledby="desk-feedback-title"><p class="idk-kicker">FEEDBACK FROM THE DESK</p><h3 id="desk-feedback-title">A second look</h3><p data-desk-review-meta></p><p class="idk-review-note" data-desk-review-note></p><p class="idk-small">This is sandbox learning feedback, not a hiring decision, employment offer, or permission to publish or deploy. Saving changed work clears earlier feedback.</p></section>
      <div class="idk-bottom-actions"><button class="idk-text-button" type="button" data-desk-reload disabled>Reload saved records</button><button class="idk-text-button idk-danger" type="button" data-desk-delete disabled>Delete this record</button></div>
      <div class="idk-recovery" data-desk-delete-confirm hidden><p>Delete this path’s saved record, interest, progress, and feedback from the desk? This also clears any unsaved edits here. Platform backups are governed separately.</p><div class="idk-actions"><button class="idk-button" type="button" data-desk-delete-yes>Delete the saved record now</button><button class="idk-button idk-outline" type="button" data-desk-delete-no>Keep this record</button></div></div>
    </section>
    <footer class="idk-footer"><p>People own the purpose.<br />People own the decision.</p><a href="/internship-lab/">Return to the public practice lab ↗</a> · <a href="/internship-desk/program.json">Read the proposed desk rules</a><small>PointCast / Private desk draft / Activation pending security review</small></footer>
  </div>
  <script>
    import { mountInternshipDesk } from '../../scripts/internship-desk.mjs';
    const root = document.querySelector('[data-internship-desk]');
    if (root) mountInternshipDesk(root);
  </script>
</BlockLayout>
